<title>JAPAN: Japan offers 500 bln yen of 1.7 pct 4-year notes.</title>
<headline>Japan offers 500 bln yen of 1.7 pct 4-year notes.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said on Tuesday it was offering 500 billion yen of 1.7 pct four-year notes through a price-competitive auction.</p>
<p>The auction will close at noon (0300 GMT) and the results will be announced at 2.30 p.m. (0530 GMT).</p>
<p>The issue date will be June 20 and the maturity date will be June 20, 2001.</p>
</text>
